    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Catch the Rolling Rice Ball!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a super simple 3D action game. Fight off the enemies and reclaim the rice ball before it gets eaten!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you skillfully deflect enemy attacks, you'll enter <strong>Ultra Focus Mode</strong>\u2014time slows down and your speed increases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeating enemies and catching the rice ball quickly will boost your score. Aim for a high score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rice ball rolls unpredictably due to physics-based movement\u2014so a bit of luck might be just what you need to catch it! Each stage is short and fast-paced, so you can play again and again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cleared stages can be replayed at any time. Try to beat your high score or fastest clear time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019ve released a video of the boss battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The boss is hungry, so its health gradually decreases over time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can choose to focus solely on dodging or go on the offensive \u2014 either way is fine. Enjoy this unique twist on a boss fight!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Catch the Rolling Rice Ball!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a super simple 3D action game. Fight off the enemies and reclaim the rice ball before it gets eaten!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you skillfully deflect enemy attacks, you'll enter <strong>Ultra Focus Mode</strong>\u2014time slows down and your speed increases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeating enemies and catching the rice ball quickly will boost your score. Aim for a high score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rice ball rolls unpredictably due to physics-based movement\u2014so a bit of luck might be just what you need to catch it! Each stage is short and fast-paced, so you can play again and again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cleared stages can be replayed at any time. Try to beat your high score or fastest clear time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019ve released a video of the boss battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The boss is hungry, so its health gradually decreases over time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can choose to focus solely on dodging or go on the offensive \u2014 either way is fine. Enjoy this unique twist on a boss fight!</p>",
    "short_description": "This simple 3D game is inspired by the classic Japanese folk tale Omusubi Kororin. Kick away the enemies that stand in your way and reclaim the lost rice ball!",
